<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<resources>
    <!--
        The band above the keys. It is the suggestion strip (D9), and it is also
        the headroom a long-press popup on the top row overhangs into, so both
        views read the same value: the keyboard's total height must not depend
        on which of the two is asking.

        One key row tall. It started at 40dp, which was room enough for the
        popups but left the suggestions reading as fine print beside the keys —
        and they are the one thing here meant to be read rather than aimed at.
    -->
    <dimen name="suggestion_strip_height">52dp</dimen>
</resources>
